# Composio API key — used server-side only (src/lib/enquirySheet.ts) to append
# buyer/seller enquiry submissions to the Google Sheet at
# https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/15QQpETCD23j7YFS6Kxeng1ErE8hc1fATUACN6AMVN10
#
# Get this from https://dashboard.composio.dev/settings — must be a key from
# the SAME Composio account/project that has the Google Sheets connection
# for ssivanesh544@gmail.com (check "Connected Accounts" in that dashboard
# to confirm googlesheets shows as connected before pasting the key here).
#
# Named MVK_COMPOSIO_API_KEY (not COMPOSIO_API_KEY) on purpose: this machine
# already has an unrelated COMPOSIO_API_KEY set system-wide, and Next.js lets
# existing OS environment variables silently override .env.local — using a
# distinct name avoids that collision.
MVK_COMPOSIO_API_KEY=
